From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: System Electronics <ci@sysele.local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc: add missing <cstdint> include for
 GCC 13

GCC 13's libstdc++ no longer transitively pulls in <cstdint> via
<cstring>, so the use of uint16_t in MMap::Sync() fails to compile
with:

  error: 'uint16_t' was not declared in this scope

Upstream-Status: Backport
Signed-off-by: System Electronics <ci@sysele.local>
---
 apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc b/apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc
--- a/apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc
+++ b/apt-pkg/contrib/mmap.cc
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #include <apt-pkg/mmap.h>

 #include <cstring>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <string>
 #include <errno.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
--
2.34.1
